  - hotspotId: ganja
    partName: Ganja
    localPosition: {x: 0.019999996, y: 0.004999995, z: -0.007799864}
    visibleFrom: 1
    title:
      id: Ganja
      en: Ganja (base plate)
    regionalTerm: 'Melayu: ganja - Jawa: ganja, gonjo'
    material:
      id: Besi/baja tempa berpamor (perlu dikonfirmasi)
      en: Forged, patterned iron/steel (to be confirmed)
    philosophy:
      id: Dalam tradisi Melayu, ganja berfungsi melindungi buku jari dari mata keris
        lawan saat bertikam.
      en: In Malay tradition, the ganja protects the knuckles from an opponent's
        blade in a fight.
    craft:
      id: Bantalan besi melintang di pangkal bilah, berlubang untuk puting; satu
        sisinya tebal dan tumpul, sisi lain meruncing tipis. Pada model dibuat terpisah
        dan dilepas pada tahap 3.
      en: The iron cross-piece at the base of the blade, pierced for the tang; one
        side is thick and blunt, the other tapers thin. On this model it is a separate
        piece, removed in step 3.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
