      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: 'Lekukan pada bilah disebut luk (Melayu: lok). Jumlahnya selalu ganjil,
        umumnya 3 sampai 13 (ada yang sampai 29); model ini dibuat dengan 7 luk dan
        panjang bilah 36 cm sesuai cetak biru.'
      en: 'The waves of the blade are called luk (Malay: lok). Their number is always
        odd, usually 3 to 13 (some up to 29); this model has 7, with a 36 cm blade,
        following the blueprint.'
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
